              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "babypenguin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really yummy, in fact I had my brother who is skeptical of everything try it, and even he said it wasn't bad, which is huge. But it's very rich and sweet, and calorie wise, it's certainly not something I would drink very often"
          },
          {
